  "aboutTitle": "Passionate software engineer — web, mobile, and end-to-end digital solutions",
  "aboutP1": "I am a passionate Software Engineer with 9+ years of professional experience in software development, with a strong focus on building Web and Mobile Applications and end-to-end digital solutions. Over the years, I have worked across a diverse range of programming languages, frameworks, tools, and technologies, gaining hands-on experience throughout the complete software development lifecycle.",
  "aboutP2": "I have experience independently designing and developing complete applications from the ground up, including mobile applications, web applications, backend services, REST APIs, database solutions, and third-party integrations. My work covers everything from planning and architecture to UI/UX implementation, application development, API integration, authentication, data management, testing, debugging, optimization, deployment, and production support.",
  "aboutP3": "My technical experience includes Flutter, Dart, Android Native, Java, JavaScript, TypeScript, React, React Native, Angular, ASP.NET, C#, .NET, HTML, CSS, jQuery, Ionic, Cordova, Python, SQL Server, Firebase, REST APIs, web services, JSON, cloud services, and various third-party SDKs and integrations. I also work with state management, application architecture, location-based services, maps, KML overlays, notifications, analytics, authentication, payment integrations, bilingual RTL/LTR, dark theme, and other modern application technologies.",
  "aboutP4": "I enjoy solving complex software engineering challenges and transforming ideas and requirements into practical, reliable, scalable, and maintainable solutions. I am particularly interested in mobile and web technologies and continuously explore new tools, frameworks, and development practices to improve the quality, performance, security, and usability of the applications I build.",
  "aboutP5": "Throughout my career, I have had the opportunity to work on a wide variety of projects and collaborate with talented teams while also taking complete ownership of projects independently. I enjoy learning from others, sharing knowledge, evaluating new technologies, and finding better and more efficient ways to solve technical problems.",
  "aboutP6": "I believe that great software is more than just well-written code. It is about understanding the problem, choosing the right technology, designing a great user experience, building a solid technical foundation, and delivering a solution that provides real and lasting value. I am always motivated by new challenges and opportunities to learn, build, innovate, and grow as a Software Engineer.",
